   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Discuss the important functions of hormone receptors.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 756972,
     "content_html": "Hormone receptors can induce cell-signaling pathways and mediate changes in target cells in the presence of hormones."
    },
    {
     "id": 756973,
     "content_html": "Hormone receptors can mediate changes in target cells and act as transcription regulators in the presence of hormones."
    },
    {
